    "summary": "Adeptus Custodes errata to weapon profiles. These become Strength 5 with AP -1: the boltgun of the **Prosecutors**, the combi-bolter of the **Venerable Contemptor Dreadnought**, the master-crafted boltgun of the **Knight-Centura**, the storm bolter of the **Anathema Psykana Rhino** and **Venerable Land Raider**, and the Vertus hurricane bolter of the **Shield-Captain on Dawneagle Jetbike** and **Vertus Praetors**. These become Strength 5 with AP left as it is: the ranged castellan axe of the **Allarus Custodians**, **Custodian Wardens**, **Shield-Captain** and **Shield-Captain in Allarus Terminator Armour**; the ranged guardian spear of the **Allarus Custodians**, **Custodian Guard**, **Custodian Wardens**, **Shield-Captain** and **Shield-Captain in Allarus Terminator Armour**; the ranged sentinel blade of the **Custodian Guard** and **Shield-Captain**; and the ranged gnosis of **Valerian**. Another Adeptus Custodes erratum, the one giving new ranged profiles to the **Shield-Captain on Dawneagle Jetbike** and **Vertus Praetors**, sets the Vertus hurricane bolter to Strength 4 instead, so the two errata disagree on its Strength wherever both apply. Where the newer Adeptus Custodes codex is in force, this entry predates it, so the profiles it targets may no longer be printed there.",
